WEBVTT

01:24.880 --> 01:26.960
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:36.640 --> 01:38.200
Mr. Zhang, you really have a warm heart.

01:38.760 --> 01:41.400
You always personally escort
my convoy's assistant back.

01:43.680 --> 01:45.800
So, I've prepared fine wine

01:45.880 --> 01:49.040
to celebrate your brush with death.

01:58.680 --> 01:59.520
Truly fine wine!

02:00.200 --> 02:01.600
If I'm not mistaken,

02:02.440 --> 02:04.680
it must be the famous
Yangzhou Qionghua Dew.

02:06.240 --> 02:07.920
You're truly worthy
of an imperial scholar.

02:08.440 --> 02:09.919
Your wine appreciation is impeccable.

02:10.440 --> 02:13.680
As they say, "A pot of wine,
a legacy of timeless elegance."

02:13.760 --> 02:15.760
Mr. Zhang, you are indeed
well-read and talented.

02:15.840 --> 02:16.680
I don't deserve such praise.

02:16.760 --> 02:18.480
No matter how knowledgeable,

02:18.560 --> 02:19.720
in Master Yan's eyes,

02:19.800 --> 02:21.000
I'm just another chess piece.

02:29.560 --> 02:31.680
I never intended
to draw you into this game.

02:32.800 --> 02:34.040
You walked into it yourself.

02:35.120 --> 02:37.160
And on the ship at Hepu,

02:37.240 --> 02:39.240
it was you who used tribute pearls
to lure me.

02:39.320 --> 02:40.720
I never expected

02:40.800 --> 02:42.240
I'd be countered by Master Yan's trick.

02:42.320 --> 02:44.320
But you got something too,
the priceless Mermaid's Tear.

02:44.400 --> 02:46.760
And perhaps the greatest gain

02:46.840 --> 02:50.400
is meeting Duanwu,
who was then a pearl hostess.

03:02.560 --> 03:04.800
You gave me the Cui family's ledger,
didn't you?

03:06.760 --> 03:08.000
I'm not that generous.

03:08.080 --> 03:10.040
But all this was part of your plan.

03:11.560 --> 03:13.040
Ever since Cui's tribute pearls
were destroyed,

03:14.440 --> 03:15.560
you've used poetry to gain fame,

03:16.480 --> 03:18.840
then forced Cui Shijiu
to hunt treasure with you.

03:18.920 --> 03:21.840
Then, using the Feng family's hand,
you bought all the pearls in Guangzhou.

03:21.920 --> 03:26.280
After that, you used South Sea merchants
to drain Cui Shijiu's wealth.

03:29.000 --> 03:30.040
Right here,

03:31.240 --> 03:33.960
you and Accountant Wei
staged a fake death.

03:34.040 --> 03:36.600
Now, the Cui family's fortune is gone,

03:36.680 --> 03:38.520
lacking the means to recover.

03:39.400 --> 03:40.840
Mr. Zhang, you're truly insightful.

03:41.760 --> 03:43.400
Observing the details

03:43.480 --> 03:44.520
and calculating everything precisely.

03:46.320 --> 03:47.680
Not as much as you,

03:47.760 --> 03:48.680
using any means necessary,

03:49.280 --> 03:50.520
leaving no stone unturned.

03:56.840 --> 03:58.920
All of this didn't need me.

03:59.000 --> 04:00.320
Why did you involve me?

04:02.360 --> 04:04.600
Since you don't want to be
someone else's weapon,

04:06.280 --> 04:09.000
you must have your own motives
in this game.

04:09.080 --> 04:11.240
Why seek the ruin of the Cui family?

04:12.200 --> 04:13.440
Does the Cui family not deserve it?

04:14.560 --> 04:15.440
Do you hold a grudge against them?

04:16.200 --> 04:17.600
An irreconcilable one.

04:22.320 --> 04:23.360
I told you before,

04:24.360 --> 04:26.880
in business, it's like a battlefield.
It's either you or me.

04:26.960 --> 04:28.640
Of course, it's a grudge to the death.

04:32.200 --> 04:34.040
I've secretly sent Cui's ledger
to Chang'an.

04:35.040 --> 04:36.400
Cui's downfall is inevitable.

04:37.760 --> 04:38.920
Does this fulfill

04:39.840 --> 04:41.040
your wish?

04:41.640 --> 04:42.840
I've just entered Tang,

04:43.600 --> 04:45.040
my grand ambitions yet to unfold.

04:45.120 --> 04:46.680
How can my wish be fulfilled?

04:46.760 --> 04:47.880
What else do you plan to do?

04:49.040 --> 04:50.360
Are you concerned for me?

04:54.280 --> 04:56.200
I have been acting on a whim.

04:56.280 --> 04:57.560
I do whatever I want.

04:58.200 --> 04:59.360
For now, I haven't decided.

05:00.480 --> 05:01.560
Fine.

05:02.960 --> 05:03.880
Then tell me.

05:04.480 --> 05:05.480
Where are you planning to go next?

05:06.600 --> 05:08.200
Are you worried about me again?

05:13.040 --> 05:13.960
Not worried about me,

05:14.720 --> 05:16.360
just someone else.

05:17.280 --> 05:18.640
Yan Zijing, let me warn you.

05:19.360 --> 05:20.760
Don't involve her in your revenge.

05:20.840 --> 05:22.800
All of this is her own choice.

05:27.840 --> 05:29.840
Since we're parting today,
let me give you a gift.

05:30.760 --> 05:32.800
Before the Yan's Trading Convoy
was seized for auction,

05:32.880 --> 05:35.440
a man named Yue approached Cui Shijiu.

05:36.640 --> 05:39.600
Since then, the Cui family has given him
ten taels of pearls annually.

05:40.760 --> 05:42.640
Are you saying
the tribute pearl case has more to it?

05:43.520 --> 05:44.640
I'll say no more.

05:45.400 --> 05:48.520
The rest is up to you to investigate.

06:08.840 --> 06:10.000
Yu Shi?

06:11.120 --> 06:13.240
Why would Mother keep his belongings?

06:14.400 --> 06:16.840
Could he be my father?

06:19.960 --> 06:23.040
Has the Zheng family in Yangzhou
heard about affairs in Guangzhou?

06:23.120 --> 06:24.160
Yes, they have.

06:24.800 --> 06:26.960
Fifth Master Zheng Zhiheng
from the Zheng family has already set out.

06:29.360 --> 06:31.760
United by profit, separated by profit.

06:32.560 --> 06:34.320
Back then, the Zheng
and Cui families conspired

06:34.400 --> 06:35.760
against my Yan family for gain.

06:36.840 --> 06:38.240
Now, once again for profit,

06:38.760 --> 06:40.200
they're at each other's throats.

06:43.280 --> 06:44.240
It's fitting.

06:45.480 --> 06:49.800
Let the Zheng family
see the Cui family to their end.

06:53.280 --> 06:56.400
We'll set out for Shaozhou tomorrow.

07:02.400 --> 07:06.680
Isn't this the same piece of jewelry
Cui Shijiu gave Shinawei?

07:09.200 --> 07:11.360
These are Yan's hairpins from Yangzhou,

07:11.960 --> 07:15.200
once popular among royal families,
highly fashionable at the time.

07:15.280 --> 07:18.760
The design catalog now rests
with my family, the Cui.

07:20.080 --> 07:22.760
Why would Mother have
the Yangzhou Yan family's designs?

07:23.760 --> 07:25.320
Mother worked at the Cui's Pearl Farm,

07:26.400 --> 07:28.960
and Yan Zijing is determined
to destroy the Cui family.

07:30.400 --> 07:32.440
What about the Yan family in Yangzhou now?

07:33.320 --> 07:37.640
What's the connection between them?

08:29.080 --> 08:30.240
Why did the ship start moving?

08:33.919 --> 08:35.960
Why did we set sail all of a sudden?

08:37.480 --> 08:38.640
Mr. Zhang and Sister Wu

08:38.720 --> 08:40.039
have helped me so much,

08:41.440 --> 08:43.440
and I didn't even get to say goodbye.

08:58.200 --> 08:59.440
Life is like a journey by ship.

09:00.280 --> 09:02.160
Sometimes, missing someone
means they're gone for good.

09:03.200 --> 09:04.240
What you need to do

09:04.840 --> 09:06.520
is to follow your heart firmly.

09:06.600 --> 09:07.760
Move forward

09:08.400 --> 09:10.680
without looking back, without lingering.

09:26.600 --> 09:29.640
Mr. Zhang gave me a parchment yesterday,

09:29.720 --> 09:31.040
said it belonged to my mother.

09:32.200 --> 09:34.160
The hairpin designs on it

09:34.240 --> 09:37.120
are identical to the seven hairpins
Cui Shijiu gave Shinawei.

09:38.600 --> 09:42.600
Cui Shijiu said they're
from the Yan family in Yangzhou.

09:45.560 --> 09:47.360
I don't know much
about the Yan family in Yangzhou.

09:49.240 --> 09:50.080
Master, do you know?

10:02.680 --> 10:03.520
They're all dead.

10:07.480 --> 10:10.080
Then, why would they be
with the Cui family?

10:11.200 --> 10:13.040
Naturally, it's because
the Cui family are thieves.

10:18.000 --> 10:19.480
What about Yu Shi?

10:19.560 --> 10:21.520
Master, do you know who Yu Shi is?

10:22.440 --> 10:24.600
I saw the name Yu Shi
signed on the parchment.

10:24.680 --> 10:25.960
Do you know where Yu Shi is?

10:38.920 --> 10:39.760
Yu Shi,

10:40.680 --> 10:43.200
seems you won't reveal
the location of the blood-stained pearl.

10:44.320 --> 10:45.960
Then, you can go die.

10:46.040 --> 10:47.280
Yes, big brother.

11:02.200 --> 11:03.160
How could I possibly know?

11:08.640 --> 11:10.640
YAN

11:16.560 --> 11:18.400
Master, do you truly have no ties

11:20.720 --> 11:21.640
to the Yan family in Yangzhou?

11:31.320 --> 11:35.040
The Yan family in Yangzhou
was completely executed,

11:36.520 --> 11:37.640
not a single one survived.

11:39.560 --> 11:40.680
How could I be related to them?

11:49.200 --> 11:50.640
Where are we headed next?

11:50.720 --> 11:53.120
First, we'll take a stretch by water,

11:53.200 --> 11:55.920
then switch to land and head to Shaozhou.

11:56.000 --> 11:58.200
From there, we'll travel north to Hexi.

11:58.280 --> 12:00.640
Hexi is in the west,
close to the Western Regions.

12:03.680 --> 12:04.920
You want to visit the Western Regions?

12:07.280 --> 12:08.320
Why?

12:09.520 --> 12:11.200
There are Gobi's sands

12:11.280 --> 12:12.440
and rare jewels.

12:13.080 --> 12:14.400
Who wouldn't want to see?

12:18.200 --> 12:19.280
Fine.

12:20.920 --> 12:21.840
Then,

12:22.560 --> 12:23.840
since we're going,

12:23.920 --> 12:25.280
could you teach me the writing
of the Western Regions?

12:25.360 --> 12:28.240
There are many small states
with various scripts.

12:28.320 --> 12:29.920
Just for border crossings, there are Han,

12:30.000 --> 12:31.560
Sogdian, and even Persian scripts.

12:36.600 --> 12:37.440
Could you take a look at this?

12:38.880 --> 12:39.720
What script is this?

12:49.400 --> 12:50.240
This is…

12:51.560 --> 12:52.560
Kharosthi script.

12:56.960 --> 12:58.080
Kharosthi?

12:59.320 --> 13:01.280
Yes, it's been lost for a long time.

13:02.960 --> 13:05.960
Then, can you teach me?

13:06.040 --> 13:07.360
So I can know what it says.

13:08.320 --> 13:09.680
Work well for me,
and I'll surely teach you.

13:12.200 --> 13:13.880
The wind's strong.
Get back to the cabin and get to work!

13:25.440 --> 13:26.880
Master, take it slow.

13:28.400 --> 13:29.480
Father.

13:32.400 --> 13:33.600
Everything is prepared?

13:35.400 --> 13:36.320
Yes.

13:37.760 --> 13:38.760
Let's set off.

13:47.280 --> 13:49.720
Father, let me go instead.

13:52.520 --> 13:54.040
This matter is too important.

13:54.960 --> 13:56.160
I need to take care of it myself.

13:59.800 --> 14:00.640
Father.

14:01.960 --> 14:02.960
Father!

14:04.400 --> 14:06.760
Your health can't handle
the journey anymore.

14:07.360 --> 14:08.640
Let me go, please.

14:09.600 --> 14:10.520
Shijiu,

14:11.440 --> 14:12.400
you're very clever.

14:13.440 --> 14:15.080
I knew this from your childhood.

14:15.880 --> 14:17.560
But you're still a woman,

14:18.320 --> 14:21.520
and there are some burdens
you shouldn't have to bear.

14:22.720 --> 14:23.920
But Father,

14:24.000 --> 14:25.320
I'm a member of the Cui family.

14:25.960 --> 14:27.360
This mistake was mine,

14:27.440 --> 14:29.680
and I must do everything to make it right!

14:48.720 --> 14:51.000
Do you understand what you're facing?

14:57.040 --> 15:00.000
Prince Tan once suggested
that I join his household.

15:02.640 --> 15:06.080
Sometimes, it's even better to be a woman.

15:07.840 --> 15:08.720
Fine.

15:09.720 --> 15:10.680
Since you've made up your mind…

15:21.400 --> 15:22.640
go then.

15:36.560 --> 15:37.400
Father.

15:39.440 --> 15:40.320
I'm leaving now.

15:41.440 --> 15:43.200
Thank you, Father.

15:55.240 --> 15:56.800
It's not that I forbade you.

15:58.960 --> 16:01.120
It's that the world doesn't allow.

16:02.880 --> 16:07.840
FUXU PORT

16:14.280 --> 16:15.320
Be careful.

16:19.600 --> 16:20.960
The ship sailed off at dawn.

16:22.000 --> 16:23.080
No one knows where it's headed.

16:25.000 --> 16:27.720
At least we got a proper farewell.

16:29.280 --> 16:31.200
The Guangzhou chapter has ended.

16:31.280 --> 16:32.560
We can finally go home.

16:36.440 --> 16:37.560
My sworn brother sent a message,

16:37.640 --> 16:40.840
saying he'll continue investigating
the Cui's Pearl Farm case.

16:40.920 --> 16:42.840
Now, Xu Nanying fled overnight,

16:43.400 --> 16:44.440
probably seeking Prince Tan's protection.

16:46.280 --> 16:47.800
Yan Zijing told me

16:48.680 --> 16:49.560
the Cui's Pearl Farm

16:49.640 --> 16:51.440
gives ten taels of pearls
to the Yue family in Shaozhou each year.

16:52.040 --> 16:53.280
The Yue family in Shaozhou?

16:54.960 --> 16:56.000
They're renowned for jade carving.

16:57.200 --> 16:58.400
So…

17:00.480 --> 17:01.600
We're heading to Shaozhou as well.

17:03.680 --> 17:04.960
Prince Ying tasked us to investigate.

17:05.599 --> 17:06.760
We've finished the investigation.

17:08.599 --> 17:09.920
But I intend to investigate Yan Zijing.

17:13.200 --> 17:15.079
Are you truly after Yan Zijing,

17:15.680 --> 17:17.079
or can't you let go of Duanwu?

17:46.120 --> 17:48.520
YAN

18:25.440 --> 18:26.600
-This way, please.
-Okay.

18:28.520 --> 18:30.920
-This way, please.
-It's all new designs.

18:31.000 --> 18:33.320
Madam Tang, I've prepared
the jewelry you requested.

18:33.400 --> 18:34.360
Duanwu,

18:35.200 --> 18:37.040
you left without a word.

18:37.120 --> 18:38.440
Was it because of some issue?

18:39.360 --> 18:40.960
May you have fair winds
and smooth sailing.

18:41.680 --> 18:44.680
When we meet again, don't forget me.

18:47.200 --> 18:48.280
Sister Wu,

18:49.160 --> 18:50.640
this farewell is rushed.

18:51.160 --> 18:52.760
Who knows when we'll meet again.

18:54.160 --> 18:58.440
May you stay safe and sound,
with wealth and abundance.

18:58.520 --> 19:00.000
When we reunite,

19:00.080 --> 19:01.800
let's rekindle our sisterhood.

19:35.800 --> 19:37.080
I don't know why,

19:38.520 --> 19:41.120
but seeing this makes me
think of that pearl diver.

19:41.200 --> 19:42.840
How am I different from her?

19:44.680 --> 19:48.200
Both of us struggling in this world,

19:48.280 --> 19:50.520
just trying to grasp our own fate.

19:52.360 --> 19:53.760
But this time,

19:54.600 --> 19:55.880
I have no power to resist.

19:57.880 --> 19:59.480
That pearl diver…

20:03.840 --> 20:05.280
I almost envy her.

20:07.880 --> 20:11.800
Master Shijiu, are you really joining
Prince Tan's household?

20:12.680 --> 20:15.200
That would make you a concubine.

20:18.880 --> 20:20.480
The Cui family has suffered
such a disaster.

20:21.360 --> 20:22.880
If we need Prince Tan's mediation,

20:23.720 --> 20:24.840
there will surely be a price.

20:27.280 --> 20:29.400
This time, I fear there's no easy way out.

20:32.480 --> 20:33.320
Hey.

20:34.440 --> 20:36.760
Isn't this Cui Shijiu?

20:36.840 --> 20:38.600
-How dare you!
-Master.

20:38.680 --> 20:40.000
It's the fifth master
from the Zheng family.

20:46.120 --> 20:47.120
Pardon my boldness,

20:48.200 --> 20:49.040
Cui Shijiu,

20:50.720 --> 20:51.800
Master.

20:52.760 --> 20:55.000
Dressed like this,

20:56.080 --> 20:57.480
how will you marry into my Zheng family?

20:59.920 --> 21:02.080
Do you think I care to marry
into your Zheng family?

21:02.880 --> 21:03.880
A mere illegitimate son,

21:04.480 --> 21:06.040
it's not your place to worry.

21:06.120 --> 21:07.080
True.

21:08.520 --> 21:10.080
But now, I'm afraid

21:10.160 --> 21:11.720
it's not about whether you care or not.

21:12.320 --> 21:13.760
With such trouble in the Cui family,

21:13.840 --> 21:14.920
whether you can marry at all

21:15.520 --> 21:16.680
is rather uncertain.

21:17.640 --> 21:18.480
Oh, by the way,

21:18.560 --> 21:21.440
I have a small villa
on the west outskirts.

21:22.240 --> 21:23.560
-Perhaps--
-Reckless fool!

21:23.640 --> 21:25.560
My master would never
be anyone's mistress!

21:26.920 --> 21:27.760
Yes.

21:27.840 --> 21:32.040
But after all,
I intend to marry Lady Shijiu.

21:47.160 --> 21:48.120
Remember this.

21:49.240 --> 21:51.600
There is no Lady Shijiu in this world.

21:53.240 --> 21:56.480
Our Cui family's matters
are none of your concern.

21:56.560 --> 21:58.320
Instead, worry about your Zheng family

21:58.400 --> 22:00.880
and how to weather this storm
in Guangzhou.

22:00.960 --> 22:03.160
After all, your Zheng family

22:03.240 --> 22:05.680
is much more entangled
with Xu Nanying's dealings.

22:05.760 --> 22:08.720
That is beyond
a mere illegitimate son's concern.

22:09.320 --> 22:11.760
I came to Guangzhou this time
just to enjoy the scenery,

22:11.840 --> 22:13.600
drink fine wine, and admire beauties.

22:14.960 --> 22:18.400
Running into the great beauty
of the Cui family today

22:19.680 --> 22:21.360
makes the trip worthwhile.

22:21.880 --> 22:22.880
Garuda.

22:23.400 --> 22:25.680
Fetch the Qionghua Dew Cui sent me

22:25.760 --> 22:27.080
and my worthless grapes.

22:28.520 --> 22:30.280
I shall enjoy them with this beauty.

22:31.800 --> 22:35.000
GUANGJIANG INN

22:44.360 --> 22:46.640
The Western Regions
are thousands of miles away,

22:47.320 --> 22:49.680
yet these fresh grapes made it here.

22:49.760 --> 22:51.960
Are you showing off to me

22:52.040 --> 22:54.120
the Zheng family's shops span the world,

22:54.200 --> 22:56.120
with goods flowing freely?

22:56.200 --> 22:57.120
I wouldn't dare.

22:57.640 --> 23:00.080
Besides, they aren't anything of value.

23:02.640 --> 23:05.320
Master Shijiu,
are you here at Guangjiang Inn

23:05.400 --> 23:07.160
planning to return to Yangzhou?

23:07.240 --> 23:08.640
What does it matter to you?

23:09.160 --> 23:12.160
You're still my fiancée on paper,

23:12.240 --> 23:14.040
yet every day, you dress like a man.

23:14.120 --> 23:15.280
It's truly…

23:16.760 --> 23:18.160
an embarrassment for me.

23:18.800 --> 23:20.160
Master Zheng,

23:20.240 --> 23:22.040
perhaps you're forgetful.

23:22.960 --> 23:24.080
Have you forgotten

23:24.760 --> 23:26.400
I've already broken off the engagement?

23:26.480 --> 23:29.520
Broken it off? I never agreed.

23:29.600 --> 23:32.000
Your engagement cancellation
means nothing.

23:34.320 --> 23:35.360
In the future,

23:36.800 --> 23:38.240
whether you agree or not won't matter.

23:38.320 --> 23:40.720
I truly don't know what you're after.

23:41.440 --> 23:43.120
Your family provides you with everything,

23:43.200 --> 23:46.240
yet you insist
on running around, dressing as a man.

23:46.760 --> 23:48.720
Besides, you don't even look the part.

23:49.240 --> 23:50.880
If you'd visit Yangzhou more often,

23:50.960 --> 23:53.680
I could teach you how to be a man.

23:53.760 --> 23:55.080
Then, at least,

23:55.160 --> 23:58.560
people wouldn't see you
as some strange, gender-mixed creature.

23:58.640 --> 23:59.800
Mr. Zheng!

23:59.880 --> 24:01.360
How dare you speak
to our master like that?

24:01.440 --> 24:02.360
Exactly!

24:02.960 --> 24:04.200
Our Master Shijiu

24:04.280 --> 24:06.360
is dashing and charming, admired by all.

24:06.440 --> 24:09.640
Fine. Go find a songstress now.

24:09.720 --> 24:11.560
Let's see if she chooses Master Shijiu

24:12.520 --> 24:13.960
or my servant Garuda.

24:15.040 --> 24:15.880
You…

24:28.000 --> 24:28.840
Do you want pearls?

24:33.520 --> 24:34.800
So, it's true.

24:34.880 --> 24:36.320
Only pearls

24:36.880 --> 24:38.880
can sway our Lady Shijiu now.

24:46.920 --> 24:48.360
Come back to Yangzhou with me.

24:52.000 --> 24:53.080
Afraid I'll poison it?

24:57.440 --> 24:58.640
I'll drink first to put you at ease.

25:05.480 --> 25:06.320
Why are you helping me?

25:06.400 --> 25:08.320
You're my fiancée on paper.

25:09.240 --> 25:10.680
How could I not help you?

25:26.600 --> 25:29.480
Your filthy tricks from the brothels,

25:30.080 --> 25:32.080
why bother using them on me?

25:32.840 --> 25:35.640
So lowly. Who would believe you?

25:38.400 --> 25:40.280
Truly Lady Shijiu,

25:40.880 --> 25:44.040
my future, impressive wife.

25:45.320 --> 25:47.640
Mere illegitimate son, foolish dreamer.

25:47.720 --> 25:49.200
And what if you
are the legitimate daughter?

25:49.840 --> 25:52.160
You still have to marry me,
an illegitimate son.

25:52.680 --> 25:55.160
Your father's well into his years,

25:55.240 --> 25:57.400
yet he's still marrying concubines,

26:02.000 --> 26:03.440
bearing sons.

26:04.960 --> 26:05.920
And you?

26:06.440 --> 26:08.400
After all your hard work,

26:08.480 --> 26:10.680
it'll end up benefiting
your little half-brothers.

26:13.200 --> 26:14.320
They?

26:15.240 --> 26:18.280
Why do you mention them, you wastrel!

26:19.800 --> 26:21.400
When have they ever shown
the slightest concern

26:21.480 --> 26:22.720
for the family's affairs?

26:23.480 --> 26:24.800
And what if I am a woman?

26:25.840 --> 26:27.400
As long as I succeed this time,

26:28.040 --> 26:30.480
I'll bring change to the Cui family
and the Yangzhou jewelry industry!

26:30.560 --> 26:33.440
Even if the Cui family
and the Yanghzou jewelry industry change,

26:35.320 --> 26:39.560
what does that have to do
with you, Lady Shijiu?

27:01.880 --> 27:06.800
GUANGJIANG INN

27:20.200 --> 27:25.280
Master Shijiu!

27:25.360 --> 27:28.240
Cui Jia! Tan!

27:29.480 --> 27:30.360
Master Shijiu!

27:35.040 --> 27:36.000
Tan!

27:39.440 --> 27:40.600
Master Shijiu!

27:44.040 --> 27:45.920
The Cui family is truly doomed.

27:46.000 --> 27:47.960
They even sent such treasures to Chang'an.

27:50.440 --> 27:52.320
If Cui Jingchu knew

27:52.400 --> 27:54.160
that the Pearl Lotus Terrace ended up
in my hands,

27:55.200 --> 27:56.400
he'd probably be furious.

28:03.240 --> 28:04.680
Just let Cui Shijiu go?

28:05.720 --> 28:06.960
The Pearl Lotus Terrace is gone,

28:07.040 --> 28:08.280
and the Cui family is doomed.

28:10.120 --> 28:11.160
Let her live.

28:13.040 --> 28:15.440
She already knows
you stole the Pearl Lotus Terrace.

28:15.960 --> 28:17.240
Do you think she'll let you go?

28:17.920 --> 28:20.400
Isn't it amusing to have a young lady

28:20.960 --> 28:22.000
constantly thinking of me?

28:23.120 --> 28:25.120
Besides, without the Pearl Lotus Terrace,

28:25.200 --> 28:26.680
she no longer needs to go to Chang'an.

28:27.520 --> 28:29.480
She swore she'd rather die than marry you.

28:32.880 --> 28:34.160
Have you traced the source
of our informant?

28:35.280 --> 28:36.480
Not yet.

28:36.560 --> 28:37.800
Keep investigating.

28:37.880 --> 28:39.400
Be careful not to become
someone else's pawn.

28:40.000 --> 28:40.960
Yes, sir.

28:45.760 --> 28:48.920
This time, we've helped
see the Cui family off.

28:50.720 --> 28:52.320
In the future,
the Yangzhou jewelry industry

28:53.720 --> 28:55.560
will be my Zheng family's domain.

28:57.400 --> 28:58.920
Let's go back to Yangzhou.

29:07.200 --> 29:08.880
How did it get so damaged?

29:26.080 --> 29:27.360
What's over here?

29:28.440 --> 29:30.040
This Kharosthi script…

29:30.560 --> 29:32.520
I can't recognize a single word.

29:35.040 --> 29:36.760
Perhaps I could…

29:56.280 --> 29:59.200
STRING

30:17.800 --> 30:23.280
YAN

30:26.640 --> 30:27.520
His foot slipped.

30:30.320 --> 30:32.320
Seems it's the same move as before.

30:32.400 --> 30:34.040
What was that move called?

30:37.960 --> 30:39.640
His strength isn't as great as mine.

30:39.720 --> 30:40.760
Thank you for yielding.

31:02.800 --> 31:03.920
-Awesome!
-This move…

31:04.000 --> 31:05.720
-Impressive!
-Nice hit!

31:07.200 --> 31:09.400
-Thank you for yielding.
-I'm heading back now.

31:10.320 --> 31:11.160
Sister, don't leave!

31:12.040 --> 31:14.600
Master said whoever wins the contest today

31:14.680 --> 31:17.080
will get that whole table of food.

31:17.160 --> 31:19.760
Look, there's even
top-grade venison on it.

31:19.840 --> 31:21.160
Just looking at it makes me hungry.

31:21.240 --> 31:22.080
Loud,

31:22.160 --> 31:23.320
aren't you strong?

31:23.880 --> 31:25.240
-Give it a try.
-Not today.

31:25.320 --> 31:26.240
I have a stomach ache today.

31:26.800 --> 31:28.440
Shrimp, can you do it?

31:28.520 --> 31:29.920
I'm just a kid.

31:30.000 --> 31:31.280
Can I even manage it?

31:31.360 --> 31:33.120
-I don't dare!
-You two are both useless.

31:34.240 --> 31:35.080
I'll go.

31:35.600 --> 31:36.880
Duanwu…

31:36.960 --> 31:38.000
Don't worry.

31:39.960 --> 31:42.200
Be careful, sister.

31:42.280 --> 31:43.120
-Duanwu!
-Sister,

31:43.200 --> 31:44.040
be careful!

31:52.600 --> 31:53.440
Master,

31:53.960 --> 31:55.440
I heard Shrimp say earlier

31:56.000 --> 31:57.800
that whoever wins today's contest

31:57.880 --> 32:00.280
gets this entire table of delicacies.

32:00.360 --> 32:01.680
No joke.

32:01.760 --> 32:02.760
Then I'll give it a try.

32:02.840 --> 32:05.040
But if I win,

32:06.960 --> 32:08.200
the delicacies on this table

32:08.840 --> 32:10.160
should be shared with all the servants.

32:11.080 --> 32:12.280
Sister, you're amazing!

32:12.360 --> 32:14.000
-Deal.
-We're all counting on you!

32:14.080 --> 32:16.360
-Go for it!
-Go, Duanwu!

32:17.760 --> 32:19.240
-Please.
-Duanwu, you can do it!

32:24.360 --> 32:25.640
Grab a suitable weapon!

32:40.080 --> 32:42.080
The shorter, the closer the risk.

32:52.800 --> 32:53.840
Wait a moment!

32:57.760 --> 32:58.920
Hold on.

33:07.000 --> 33:08.040
That's shorter.

33:08.640 --> 33:10.400
Maybe you should use this one.

33:15.240 --> 33:16.120
Thanks.

33:17.880 --> 33:22.160
Sister, I want lamb hooves and venison!

33:22.240 --> 33:24.280
-Duanwu, be careful!
-Be careful!

33:24.360 --> 33:27.160
-Sister!
-Duanwu!

33:30.600 --> 33:33.320
-Duanwu!
-She's so small, yet so fierce.

33:33.400 --> 33:34.840
Admirable courage.

33:34.920 --> 33:37.600
But her moves are completely unstructured.

33:37.680 --> 33:39.600
To figure it out herself to this level

33:39.680 --> 33:40.520
-is already impressive.
-Duanwu!

33:41.720 --> 33:43.000
Careful. Watch out!

33:43.600 --> 33:45.200
-Sister!
-Truly the first time.

33:46.120 --> 33:47.080
A first, indeed.

33:47.680 --> 33:49.960
-Find her a proper short sword later.
-Duanwu!

33:50.040 --> 33:51.440
Right now, she's suited
to practice thrusts.

33:51.520 --> 33:52.840
There's no time
to teach her proper technique.

33:52.920 --> 33:55.240
-You seem to want her to learn everything.
-Duanwu!

33:55.320 --> 33:56.800
She wants to stand on her own.

33:56.880 --> 33:58.440
I'm simply helping her along.

33:59.160 --> 34:01.480
Many people in this world
are stuck in misery,

34:01.560 --> 34:02.880
yet don't want to lift a finger.

34:03.480 --> 34:05.760
She wants to save herself,

34:06.280 --> 34:07.280
so I'll give her a hand.

34:07.880 --> 34:09.520
Watch out for sneak attacks!

34:09.600 --> 34:10.719
Be careful!

34:27.960 --> 34:29.920
Thank you for going easy on me.

34:30.000 --> 34:31.000
Well done, Duanwu!

34:31.080 --> 34:32.280
Duanwu, you're amazing!

34:32.360 --> 34:33.280
He lost gracefully.

34:34.560 --> 34:35.560
Master,

34:35.639 --> 34:36.880
what do you say?

34:40.000 --> 34:40.840
Very well.

34:43.239 --> 34:44.800
I'll have the kitchen prepare more.

34:46.679 --> 34:48.040
Please, enjoy.

34:51.480 --> 34:52.320
Thank you, Master!

34:52.400 --> 34:54.120
Thank you, Master!

34:56.000 --> 34:58.680
Sister, you're incredible!

34:58.760 --> 35:00.600
Lamb hooves!

35:02.600 --> 35:03.640
Thank you, Duanwu!

35:03.720 --> 35:05.080
It's my first time having such a feast!

35:05.160 --> 35:06.040
Shrimp!

35:06.120 --> 35:07.080
Shrimp!

35:07.600 --> 35:08.680
Come have some lamb hooves!

35:08.760 --> 35:10.480
I want lamb hooves!

35:13.760 --> 35:15.400
-You can't reach me.
-Look over there!

35:17.600 --> 35:18.600
-It's beautiful over there.
-So beautiful.

35:18.680 --> 35:21.120
-Yes, indeed.
-Do you see it?

35:21.640 --> 35:23.640
I've never felt the ocean like this.

35:27.760 --> 35:29.360
The breeze feels so nice.

35:29.440 --> 35:30.440
Duanwu!

35:32.560 --> 35:33.560
Supervisor Kang.

35:33.640 --> 35:35.040
Wait for me here.

35:35.840 --> 35:36.960
Come on, Shrimp.

35:37.040 --> 35:38.720
Thank you, sister.

35:38.800 --> 35:40.120
So comfortable!

35:40.200 --> 35:41.960
Are you happy, Shrimp?

35:42.560 --> 35:44.720
Supervisor Kang, what's the matter?

35:46.600 --> 35:47.600
This is for you.

35:50.400 --> 35:52.600
A nice short sword. Take a look.

36:03.200 --> 36:04.080
Thank you, Supervisor Kang.

36:04.160 --> 36:05.040
Wait a moment.

36:05.720 --> 36:06.560
Hold on.

36:07.840 --> 36:08.880
Look over there!

36:09.760 --> 36:10.760
So beautiful!

36:13.360 --> 36:15.640
Look at that! Did you see that fish?

36:16.880 --> 36:18.200
Supervisor Kang!

36:18.280 --> 36:19.720
Here. Here you go!

36:21.160 --> 36:22.760
This is a little crossbow I made myself.

36:22.840 --> 36:23.880
Don't be fooled by its size.

36:23.960 --> 36:26.280
It can save your life when it counts.

36:26.360 --> 36:28.280
I'm giving it to you. Let's trade.

36:29.800 --> 36:30.640
Duanwu,

36:31.160 --> 36:32.160
this is the Master's intention.

36:35.640 --> 36:36.520
The Master gives this sword to me?

36:40.960 --> 36:43.200
But this little crossbow
is quite interesting.

36:44.040 --> 36:45.280
How should I use it?

36:47.040 --> 36:48.560
Hold it, and I'll teach you.

36:48.640 --> 36:50.040
First, put it on your wrist.

36:50.640 --> 36:51.480
Tie it securely to your wrist.

36:52.080 --> 36:53.040
Then, look.

36:54.640 --> 36:56.200
You can aim at any target.

36:56.880 --> 36:57.760
Do you see?

36:57.840 --> 36:58.880
Like there.

37:03.560 --> 37:05.560
-It's quite delicate and compact.
-Duanwu,

37:07.320 --> 37:08.320
practice close combat more.

37:08.840 --> 37:09.680
It could save your life when needed.

37:10.360 --> 37:11.960
Thank you for the short sword!

37:15.520 --> 37:16.840
Shrimp!

37:17.640 --> 37:19.000
Sit up. Be careful.

37:20.880 --> 37:22.560
Well, that crossbow…

37:25.000 --> 37:26.040
Here you go.

37:27.920 --> 37:29.520
-Could I borrow it for a few days?
-Sure.

37:30.040 --> 37:32.000
If you can't figure it out,
remember to come find me.

37:33.360 --> 37:34.440
Okay.

39:03.160 --> 39:06.560
YAN

39:08.440 --> 39:09.280
Master.

39:11.800 --> 39:12.840
Come in.

39:31.360 --> 39:32.560
What's wrong?

39:32.640 --> 39:35.600
Didn't you say you would teach me
Kharosthi? Remember?

39:40.040 --> 39:41.680
I have something to do now.
Let's postpone it.

39:48.240 --> 39:49.280
Though you're not a gentleman,

39:49.360 --> 39:51.440
in business, a promise should be kept.

39:53.920 --> 39:54.800
Fine.

39:55.600 --> 39:57.480
Forget it. Maybe you can't read it.

39:59.120 --> 40:01.400
Come here. Let me see.

40:03.560 --> 40:04.400
Thank you, Master.

40:07.280 --> 40:08.120
Look…

40:11.520 --> 40:12.440
Where are you going?

40:22.160 --> 40:24.040
What does this mean?

40:26.240 --> 40:27.800
This is…

40:31.560 --> 40:32.480
the art of extraction.

40:36.560 --> 40:37.400
The art of extraction?

40:39.360 --> 40:40.240
And what about this?

40:40.320 --> 40:41.320
Here.

40:41.400 --> 40:42.280
This one…

40:45.600 --> 40:47.080
This is…

40:49.720 --> 40:50.640
Autumn Pomegranate.

40:53.600 --> 40:54.520
What's wrong?

40:58.400 --> 40:59.320
And this one?

41:02.720 --> 41:04.040
Let me think.

41:10.640 --> 41:11.560
This is…

41:12.840 --> 41:15.040
Summer Lily.

41:18.760 --> 41:20.040
You're just describing the shapes

41:20.760 --> 41:21.600
and tricking me.

41:22.760 --> 41:23.600
Come back!

41:24.480 --> 41:27.320
I just haven't spoken Kharosthi
in a long time,

41:27.400 --> 41:30.400
-so I'm a bit rusty.
-Still pretending!

41:31.000 --> 41:32.480
If you don't understand, just admit it!

41:32.560 --> 41:33.600
Just wait!

41:35.160 --> 41:36.040
Come here.

41:40.600 --> 41:41.440
Sit down.

41:49.480 --> 41:50.560
I don't understand?

41:52.080 --> 41:53.120
Look for yourself.

42:00.320 --> 42:01.560
Identical!

42:02.760 --> 42:03.600
A replica?

42:04.880 --> 42:05.760
What replica?

42:05.840 --> 42:06.960
I, Yan Zijing, use replicas?

42:08.160 --> 42:09.200
It's the real thing!

42:11.160 --> 42:12.080
Really?

42:12.600 --> 42:13.640
Of course!

42:27.560 --> 42:29.400
Why do you have items from the parchment?

42:30.000 --> 42:31.200
Isn't that normal?

42:31.720 --> 42:33.560
A master's work ends up
in the hands of the common folk.

42:33.640 --> 42:35.400
-What's so strange about it?
-Master?

42:37.080 --> 42:38.120
You mean Yu Shi?

42:39.240 --> 42:41.800
Yes. Regarding Yu Shi,

42:41.880 --> 42:43.440
he's the chief craftsman
of the Yan family in Yangzhou,

42:44.240 --> 42:46.240
exceptionally creative and skillful,

42:46.800 --> 42:47.880
quite sought after.

42:48.560 --> 42:50.160
When I asked you before,
you said you didn't know him!

42:50.960 --> 42:52.760
I was just too lazy
to bother with you then.

42:55.960 --> 42:56.960
If that's the case,

42:58.160 --> 42:59.480
Yu Shi is in the Western Regions?
